{"ref":"BDB, מְצוּרָה","hw":"מְצוּרָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מְצוּרָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. siege-works, rampart</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 2:2\" href=\"/Nahum.2.2\">Na 2:2</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 14:5\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.14.5\">2 Ch 14:5</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְצוּרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 11:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.11.11\">2 Ch 11:11</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">מְצֻרֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.3\">Is 29:3</a>, etc.;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>siege-works</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.3\">Is 29:3</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>rampart</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">נָצוֹר מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 2:2\" href=\"/Nahum.2.2\">Na 2:2</a> <em>guard the rampart!</em> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">צַפֵּה דֶרֶךְ</span>; We Now der. from <span dir=\"rtl\">נצר</span>, i.e. <em>keep watch!</em>), <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 11:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.11.11\">2 Ch 11:11</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עָרֵי מְצוּרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 14:5\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.14.5\">14:5</a> <em>fortified</em> cities, so <span dir=\"rtl\">עָרֵי (הַ)מְצֻרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 11:10\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.11.10\">11:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 11:23\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.11.23\">23</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 12:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.12.4\">12:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 21:3\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.21.3\">21:3</a>.","next":"BDB, צוּר²","prev":"BDB, מָצוֹר⁴"}